# Answer 8 · Deconstructing the Word "Gender" (CSS 2020)
@py question 2020-2

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
@note Explain what deconstruction means, peel the word's meanings layer by layer, then expose the ranked pair masculine/feminine.
@ask Gender has MULTIPLE MEANINGS
@ask HOW DO YOU DECONSTRUCT the word "GENDER"?
(1) Introduction: "gender" is used everywhere but means different things; deconstruction takes it apart
(2) What deconstruction is: Derrida showed ideas rest on ranked pairs of opposites
